title: Psalms 58–60: Hard Preaching, and Through God We Shall Do Valiantly
description: Psalms 58 and 60 in the King James Bible: hard preaching and imprecatory prayer, do ye indeed speak righteousness, O congregation, break their teeth, O God, the sudden wrath of God, and David's wars with Syria, Ammon and Edom, the banner of the LORD and prophecy fulfilled, from the Psalms series studies.
output: lessons/bible/psalms-58-60.html
context: yes

